rds set by Nexus-Prince Shaffar; they have attempted to breach the gates with little success, but have still tested whether or not their efforts worked - often resulting in the spotaneous combustion (for lack of a better term) of the ethereal tester sent through the gate. According to the Consortium, the ethereals in the Mana-Tombs are robbing it blind and if you wish to do business with them, you'll have to aid in taking out the competition.",lvl=61,mapID=272,savedInstanceID=557,u=17,["zone-text-names"]={DUNGEON_FLOOR_MANATOMBS1},g={h(-45,{awp=20001,u=17,g={q(29583,{awp=40300,coords={{57.6,53.6,1952}},isBreadcrumb=1,lvl=64,qgs={21400},r=2,u=17}),q(29582,{awp=40300,coords={{49.8,45.3,1952}},isBreadcrumb=1,lvl=64,qgs={19606},r=1,u=17}),q(29574,{awp=40300,lvl=62,qgs={54694},u=17,g={qo(1,{awp=20001,providers={{"i",72126}},u=17}),qo(2,{awp=20001,providers={{"i",72127}},u=17})}}),q(10981,{awp=20001,coords={{52.8,15,1949}},cost={{"i",31941,1}},lvl=70,maxReputation={933,42000},minReputation={933,21000},qgs={22919},repeatable=1,sourceQuests={10977},u=17,g={i(32079,{awp=20001,q=2,u=17})}}),q(10216,{coords={{39.4,58.5,1952}},lvl=64,providers={{"o",183877}},qgs={19670},rwp=40300,u=2,g={qo(1,{awp=20001,providers={{"n",18311}},u=17}),qo(2,{awp=20001,providers={{"n",18314}},u=17}),qo(3,{awp=20001,providers={{"n",18313}},u=17}),qo(4,{awp=20001,providers={{"n",18312}},u=17})}}),q(29573,{awp=40300,lvl=62,qgs={54692},u=17,g={qo(1,{awp=20001,providers={{"n",18311}},u=17}),qo(2,{awp=20001,providers={{"n",18313}},u=17}),qo(3,{awp=20001,providers={{"n",18314}},u=17}),qo(4,{awp=20001,providers={{"n",18312}},u=17})}}),q(10218,{lvl=64,maps={1952},providers={{"o",183877}},qgs={19671},rwp=40300,sourceQuests={10216},u=2,g={s(139674,29328,{b=1,f=4,q=3,rwp=40300,u=2}),s(139673,29327,{b=1,f=5,q=3,rwp=40300,u=2}),s(139672,29326,{b=1,f=6,q=3,rwp=40300,u=2}),s(139671,29325,{b=1,f=7,q=3,rwp=40300,u=2})}}),q(10977,{awp=20001,coords={{52.8,15,1949}},lvl=70,qgs={22919},sourceQuests={10976},u=17,g={qo(1,