ains of the human population retains control of the southern forest, but they are desperate and their forces thinly stretched. Dalaran sends frequent expeditions into Silverpine to defend these people and study the undead plague and worgen curse — a mysterious affliction that causes its victims to transform into bloodthirsty, lycanthropic worgen when the moon rises.",g={h(-12,{ach(769,{awp=30002,g={crit(1292,{achID=42,awp=30002,id=1})}}),ach(4894,{awp=40003,r=1,sourceQuests={27056,27096,27290,27438,27518,27601},g={crit(9081,{achID=1677,id=1,rwp=50004})}})}),h(-30,{exp(233,{crit(1063,{achID=769,awp=30002,id=1})}),exp(231),exp(213,{crit(1061,{achID=769,awp=30002,id=1})}),exp(172,{crit(1058,{achID=769,awp=30002,id=1})}),exp(5369,{crit(1065,{achID=769,awp=30002,id=1})}),exp(5386,{crit(14159,{achID=769,awp=30002,id=1})}),exp(928,{crit(1057,{achID=769,awp=30002,id=1})}),exp(305,{crit(14160,{achID=769,awp=30002,id=1})}),exp(229,{crit(1062,{achID=769,awp=30002,id=1})}),exp(5476),exp(5478),exp(204),exp(236,{crit(1064,{achID=769,awp=30002,id=1})}),exp(5456,{crit(1053,{achID=769,awp=30002,id=1})}),exp(232),exp(237,{crit(1054,{achID=769,awp=30002,id=1})}),exp(5387,{crit(1055,{achID=769,awp=30002,id=1})}),exp(230,{crit(14046,{achID=4827,awp=40003,id=1})}),exp(239),exp(228,{crit(1060,{achID=769,awp=30002,id=1})}),exp(226,{crit(1056,{achID=769,awp=30002,id=1})}),exp(227,{crit(1059,{achID=769,awp=30002,id=1})})}),h(-32,{fp(645,{awp=40003,coords={{57.8,8.8,1421}},crs={44825},r=1}),fp(681,{awp=40003,coords={{45.8,21.8,1421}},crs={50463},r=1}),fp(654,{awp=40001,coords={{50.8,63.6,1421}},crs={46552},r=1}),fp(10,{coords={{45.4,42.4,1421}},crs={2226},r=1})}),h(-45,{q(27577,{awp=40003,coords={{51.8,65,1421}},qgs={45879},r=1,sourceQuests={27547,27548,27550},g={qo(1,{awp=40003,crs={45855,45995},providers={{"i",61510}}})}}),q(530,{coords={{62,43,1458}},lvl=10,qgs={2050},r=1,rwp=40003,sourceQuests={441},u=2,g={qo(1,{coords={{46.4,84.6,1421}},crs={2332},providers={{"i",3613}},rwp=40003,u=2}),i