pawn window, but finding him can be helpful. Tracking Blood Seeker's spawns will help you keep track of when it is possible for Aeonaxx to spawn. Whenever you are able to spot this bat, it means that you can safely take a break from your camping for 2 hours, as there will not be a spawn until the minimum timer has passed (2 hours). Aeonaxx is often thought of as \"the rare spawn of Blood Seeker.\" Simply put, this means that there is a small chance for Aeonaxx to spawn instead of Blood Seeker whenever a spawn is due.",g={mnt(88718,{awp=40001,b=1,itemID=63042,lvl=70,q=4})}}),n(50059,{awp=40001,coords={{32.8,76.4,207},{37.6,81.6,207},{43.6,87.8,207},{45.8,84.2,207}},g={s(211110,67237,{awp=40001,f=4,lvl=83,q=3})}}),n(49822,{awp=40001,coords={{61.2,22.6,207}},description="Found inside Crumbling Depths, requires the daily quest Underground Economy. Use the bomb \"Ricket's Tickers\" in the central cavern to reach the cave where Jadefang spawns.",g={p(279,{awp=40001,b=1,itemID=64494,npcID=48982,petTypeID=7,q=1,spellID=91343})}}),n(50060,{awp=40001,coords={{55,25.6,207}},g={s(211111,67238,{awp=40001,f=7,lvl=83,q=3})}})}}),h(-58,{awp=40001,g={n(45408,{awp=40001,coords={{56.8,13.2,207}},g={s(210119,65907,{awp=40001,b=1,f=9,minReputation={1171,3000},q=1}),i(62342,{awp=40001,b=1,f=55,lvl=85,minReputation={1171,9000},q=3}),i(62344,{awp=40001,b=1,f=55,lvl=85,minReputation={1171,9000},q=3}),i(62347,{awp=40001,b=1,f=55,lvl=85,minReputation={1171,9000},q=3}),i(62321,{awp=40001,b=1,f=55,lvl=85,minReputation={1171,9000},q=3}),i(62352,{awp=40001,b=1,f=52,lvl=85,minReputation={1171,21000},q=3}),i(62351,{awp=40001,b=1,f=52,lvl=85,minReputation={1171,21000},q=3}),i(62350,{awp=40001,b=1,f=52,lvl=85,minReputation={1171,21000},q=3}),i(62348,{awp=40001,b=1,f=52,lvl=85,minReputation={1171,21000},q=3}),i(226463,{awp=40001,b=1,description="This version is only visible on the vendor when you aren't at the required reputation to purchase it yet on your current character.",f=55,lvl=85,minReputation